WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the Vietnamese narration

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.551
Welcome to BizOn.

2
00:00:02.551 --> 00:00:07.900
Simulation-based business learning, designed
in the Mekong Delta and built for the world.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.700
At BizOn, students, instructors, researchers
and institutions each have their own way in.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.800
Three game levels in one ecosystem.

5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.491
Start at Level 1 with Bến Phù Sa: a
street-vendor start-up on the floating market;

6
00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:29.100
run a company through six
decision rounds in Bật Nghiệp,

7
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.600
then go global with Brand
Passport and Durian Passport.

8
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.800
You can also practise one skill
at a time in the practicum labs,

9
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.300
such as the international entrepreneurship
lab, Gravity, FDI and the Arcade.

10
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.100
Every game has its own trailer
– watch it before you play.

11
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.600
The simulation engine is
deterministic and transparent,

12
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.500
so every result can be inspected,
discussed and reproduced.

13
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.800
BizOn is built on one
principle: from research

14
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.800
to decision, to evidence.

15
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.800
Start with Bến Phù Sa at bizonland.com.

16
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.700
Thank you for stopping by and
listening to our introduction to BizOn.
